# Read by ripgrep (Claude Code's Grep, `rg`) in addition to .gitignore. These are generated or bulky files
# that match almost any search and bury the real hit. Search the sources instead:
#   1922/1940/1941: src/parts/*.jsx   1914: src/*.jsx   Frankenstein: src/content/frankenstein/*.json
# To look inside one on purpose: `rg --no-ignore -n "text" "Dispatches 1941/src/App.jsx"`. Game save fixtures (tests/saves) are hidden too: open them directly..
# Plain names, not paths: path patterns through the folders with spaces in their names did not match when tested.
App.jsx
dispatches-greatwar.jsx
baseline.json
baseline/
ui-runs/
saves/
package-lock.json
*.map
